  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 As\u0131\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin
    {{isim}}.\n\nSan\u0131yorum senin ad\u0131na hi\xE7bir \u015Fey \xE7ok kolay
    olmuyor. Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin adeta sava\u015Farak ge\xE7mi\u015F. \u0130stedi\u011Fin
    hemen her \u015Fey i\xE7in m\xFCcadele etmek durumunda kalm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    \u0130\u015Fin iyi yan\u0131 ise \u015Fu; kart\u0131n, hi\xE7bir zorluk kar\u015F\u0131s\u0131nda
    vazge\xE7medi\u011Fini ve hedeflerin do\u011Frultusunda her zaman kararl\u0131l\u0131kla
    ilerledi\u011Fini s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Hen\xFCz varamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n baz\u0131
    hedefler var ki, senin taraf\u0131ndan \xE7ok eski zamanlarda belirlenmi\u015F.
    Onlara hen\xFCz ula\u015Famasan da, varmay\u0131 bir defa kafana koymu\u015Fsun.
    Seni amac\u0131na ula\u015Ft\u0131rabilecek her fikri de\u011Ferlendirmi\u015F,
    her kap\u0131y\u0131 \xE7alarak bug\xFCnlere gelmi\u015Fsin."
